157
07:54.399 --> 07:56.120
(Passerby A: Do you need a sister?) to you myself

158
07:56.240 --> 07:57.000
(Homebody Cat: Put him on the link,) and count it as your win.

159
07:57.000 --> 07:57.728
(or it'd be the ultimate disrespect to consumers)

160
07:57.728 --> 07:58.528
