191
09:06.039 --> 09:07.240
No idea who took it.

192
09:08.879 --> 09:09.320
Zhang Tao.

193
09:10.240 --> 09:10.960
Look into it.

194
09:11.919 --> 09:13.039
Find out who did this.

195
09:13.360 --> 09:13.960
Got it.

196
09:15.519 --> 09:16.120
Go ahead.

197
09:16.440 --> 09:18.080
Tell me once you find out.

198
09:18.559 --> 09:20.240
But I'm keeping these photos.

199
09:20.360 --> 09:21.639
This is my golden opportunity

200
09:21.679 --> 09:22.519
