201
09:23.840 --> 09:25.120
As you wish.

202
10:08.759 --> 10:09.559
Lost again.

203
10:10.559 --> 10:11.120
Have a rest.

204
10:11.600 --> 10:12.399
Here you go.

205
10:14.159 --> 10:15.240
Where are you aiming at?

206
10:18.080 --> 10:18.559
Pick it up.

207
10:30.720 --> 10:31.440
Honey?

208
10:32.799 --> 10:33.399
Honey.

209
10:34.120 --> 10:34.759
Why coming here?

210
10:35.440 --> 10:36.480
What about the event?

211
10:36.960 --> 10:38.519
I finished it early today,

212
10:38.879 --> 10:39.759
so I come

213
10:39.759 --> 10:41.120
to play for fun with Zi.

214
10:42.440 --> 10:42.840
Zi,

215
10:43.080 --> 10:44.159
you go rest over there.

216
10:44.440 --> 10:45.600
I need to talk to Liren.

217
10:48.720 --> 10:49.320
Honey.

218
10:49.759 --> 10:50.759
I just remembered

219
10:51.559 --> 10:53.080
the photos you saw last time

220
10:53.399 --> 10:54.799
was likely taken last week.

221
10:55.519 --> 10:56.480
Don't misunderstand.

222
10:58.279 --> 10:59.080
Let me tell you.

223
10:59.639 --> 11:01.559
Chen was with Mr. Han that day.

224
11:02.080 --> 11:03.759
I was just covering for him,

225
11:04.159 --> 11:05.240
and doing him a favor.

226
11:06.399 --> 11:07.120
I know.

227
11:08.679 --> 11:09.320
Honey,

228
11:10.000 --> 11:11.919
how long have you been practicing here?

229
11:12.240 --> 11:13.440
All told,

230
11:13.600 --> 11:14.600
it's been five months.

231
11:15.039 --> 11:16.159
Mr. Han has been cooperating

232
11:16.200 --> 11:16.879
with us.

233
11:17.159 --> 11:18.360
I want to negotiate

234
11:18.600 --> 11:20.240
a new project contract with him.

235
11:21.360 --> 11:22.840
But he hasn't given me the chance.

236
11:23.159 --> 11:24.559
Lately he's gotten into tennis

237
11:24.559 --> 11:25.080
and hiking.

238
11:25.679 --> 11:26.320
He signed me up

239
11:26.320 --> 11:27.399
for next month's marathon.

240
11:27.679 --> 11:28.360
What can I do?

241
11:28.480 --> 11:30.120
I have to go along with it.

242
11:30.799 --> 11:32.159
No wonder you've been

243
11:32.240 --> 11:33.519
morning jogging lately.

244
11:34.519 --> 11:35.120
Meng.

245
11:36.000 --> 11:36.759
Long time no see.

246
11:37.039 --> 11:38.360
Long time no see, Mr. Han.

247
11:39.039 --> 11:40.039
Liren told me

248
11:40.039 --> 11:40.879
he'd be meeting

249
11:40.879 --> 11:41.960
an important friend today

250
11:41.960 --> 11:42.879
and insisted I come.

251
11:42.919 --> 11:44.399
But I had an event earlier,

252
11:44.480 --> 11:45.960
and got delayed a bit.

253
11:46.240 --> 11:46.919
So I'm late.

254
11:47.200 --> 11:48.360
It's okay.

255
11:48.799 --> 11:49.639
Let me introduce

256
11:49.639 --> 11:51.759
our company's PR director,

257
11:51.840 --> 11:53.799
also my sister-in-law, Weng Yue.

258
11:54.440 --> 11:54.879
Yu Meng.

259
11:56.519 --> 11:57.440
Hello, Miss Weng.

260
11:57.480 --> 11:58.639
I've seen your posts.

261
11:59.039 --> 12:00.039
Lucky Beauty Yu.

262
12:00.159 --> 12:01.000
With many followers.

263
12:01.440 --> 12:02.480
Not really.

264
12:02.639 --> 12:03.480
Just sharing my life.

265
12:04.679 --> 12:05.879
No nutritional value indeed.

266
12:11.440 --> 12:12.799
So Miss Weng,

267
12:12.919 --> 12:14.120
you're studying nutrition?

268
12:14.360 --> 12:15.919
You can even tell

269
12:16.000 --> 12:17.664
if my account has nutritional value.

270
12:18.120 --> 12:19.360
Actually, I do enjoy watching

271
12:19.759 --> 12:20.440
short videos.

272
12:20.600 --> 12:21.240
It's a trend.

273
12:21.480 --> 12:22.399
How many followers now?

274
12:22.600 --> 12:23.360
Over a million?

275
12:23.600 --> 12:24.759
Relied on Dad as a kid,

276
12:24.919 --> 12:26.039
and relies on husband now.

277
12:26.120 --> 12:26.840
People just

278
12:26.879 --> 12:27.720
find it novel.

279
12:28.639 --> 12:30.120
Miss Weng knows me so well.

280
12:30.480 --> 12:31.440
She knows everything.

281
12:31.879 --> 12:33.399
That means my life

282
12:33.600 --> 12:34.840
is quite interesting,

283
12:35.120 --> 12:35.799
or why would you

284
12:35.799 --> 12:36.559
know me so well?

285
12:38.000 --> 12:38.600
Not at all.

286
12:38.919 --> 12:39.679
I don't know you.

287
12:40.159 --> 12:42.159
But I know trophy wives well.

288
12:42.559 --> 12:43.519
My sister is one.

289
12:43.879 --> 12:45.679
Usually she doesn't come to the office.

290
12:46.120 --> 12:47.200
But when she shows up,

291
12:47.200 --> 12:48.200
people have to praise her

292
12:48.240 --> 12:49.440
for being amazing and capable.

293
12:50.720 --> 12:52.352
What a tough life, Mr. Di.

294
12:55.279 --> 12:56.960
But you can't take a part for the whole.

295
12:57.080 --> 12:58.399
You can't assume everyone else

296
12:58.600 --> 12:59.600
is like your sister.

297
12:59.720 --> 13:00.399
Miss Weng,

298
13:00.519 --> 13:01.600
you should

299
13:01.759 --> 13:03.600
broaden your perspective.

300
13:06.840 --> 13:07.399
Mr. Han,

301
13:08.240 --> 13:09.080
my wife Meng

302
13:09.240 --> 13:10.279
plays tennis really well.

303
13:10.799 --> 13:12.240
She taught me how to play.

304
13:12.679 --> 13:14.080
Perfect, let's play a match.

305
13:14.519 --> 13:15.759
If you win,

306
13:15.799 --> 13:16.799
for the new contract,

307
13:16.960 --> 13:19.120
I'll give another 0.5 percent concession.

308
13:19.320 --> 13:20.240
If you lose,

309
13:20.519 --> 13:22.639
you give me another 0.5 percent.

310
13:23.000 --> 13:23.600
Deal?

311
13:25.840 --> 13:27.679
Since Mr. Han proposed it,

312
13:27.840 --> 13:28.639
how about

313
13:29.080 --> 13:30.039
we round it up?

314
13:30.480 --> 13:31.000
One percent.

315
13:31.399 --> 13:31.919
How's it?

316
13:32.039 --> 13:32.639
Deal.

317
13:38.080 --> 13:39.080
Check please.

318
13:39.399 --> 13:40.200
Court three.

319
13:40.240 --> 13:40.960
Booked by Mr. Di.

320
13:41.080 --> 13:42.240
Okay, just a moment.

321
13:43.039 --> 13:44.080
Will Mr. Han back out

322
13:44.159 --> 13:45.639
on the concession he promised?

323
13:46.519 --> 13:47.480
Don't take it seriously.

324
13:47.679 --> 13:48.759
He was just saying that.

325
13:49.240 --> 13:50.759
Then why did you go all out just now?

326
13:51.799 --> 13:52.759
Han Guang didn't budge.

327
13:52.840 --> 13:54.120
The contract isn't finalized.

328
13:54.120 --> 13:54.879
How did he know

329
13:54.919 --> 13:55.960
how much one percent is?

330
13:56.360 --> 13:57.879
