1013
41:16.360 --> 41:17.480
I'm in no rush to go back.

1014
41:17.639 --> 41:19.199
With you all here, I'm at ease.

1015
41:20.760 --> 41:21.960
Rourou, you're here.

1016
41:26.679 --> 41:27.440
(She is Zhang Yu,)

1017
41:27.960 --> 41:29.719
(the Product Director of Jiali,)

1018
41:30.000 --> 41:31.280
(hailed as the closest thing)

1019
41:31.480 --> 41:32.480
(to an AI work machine)

1020
41:32.480 --> 41:33.239
(in the company.)

1021
41:34.199 --> 41:36.800
I heard Liren really appreciates her

1022
41:36.800 --> 41:37.239
(Zhang Yu, Product Director of Jiali)

1023
41:37.239 --> 41:38.159
and relies on her input

1024
41:38.320 --> 41:39.639
for projects.

1025
41:41.840 --> 41:42.480
Hello, Mrs. Di.

1026
41:43.719 --> 41:44.360
Welcome!

1027
41:46.039 --> 41:47.039
My laptop is power off.

1028
41:47.039 --> 41:48.199
I have emails to reply to.

1029
41:48.480 --> 41:50.159
Is there an outlet I could use?

1030
41:50.360 --> 41:51.159
Go to the study.

1031
41:51.480 --> 41:52.239
Charge it there.

1032
41:52.840 --> 41:53.199
Thanks.

1033
41:54.528 --> 41:56.960
(Amber Perfume)

1034
42:02.079 --> 42:02.679
(They are)

1035
42:02.679 --> 42:04.360
(the new hires from marketing.)

1036
42:04.760 --> 42:06.159
(Vibrant,)

1037
42:06.480 --> 42:07.320
(energetic,)

1038
42:08.239 --> 42:09.639
(and great at pleasing people.)

1039
42:09.639 --> 42:10.199
Mrs. Di.

1040
42:10.760 --> 42:11.960
- Hello, Mrs. Di. - Hello!

1041
42:12.199 --> 42:12.679
Hello.

1042
42:14.320 --> 42:14.920
(Yu Meng,)

1043
42:15.960 --> 42:16.679
(stay calm.)

1044
42:17.559 --> 42:18.599
(Do you really think)

1045
42:18.599 --> 42:19.880
(every smart, attractive woman)

1046
42:20.599 --> 42:21.920
(has their eye on your husband?)

1047
42:28.559 --> 42:29.719
Hi again, Meng.

1048
42:30.719 --> 42:31.800
I was going over contracts

1049
42:31.840 --> 42:32.679
with your company,

1050
42:32.840 --> 42:33.880
and they brought me along.

1051
42:33.880 --> 42:34.840
So here I am.

1052
42:35.079 --> 42:36.599
I hope you don't mind.

1053
42:37.320 --> 42:38.039
Of course not.

1054
42:38.639 --> 42:39.199
Welcome!

1055
42:39.456 --> 42:40.360
(Amber Perfume)

1056
42:40.360 --> 42:40.719
Come.

1057
42:42.400 --> 42:43.599
I only heard today

1058
42:43.679 --> 42:44.840
that you worked at Jiali,

1059
42:45.400 --> 42:46.239
and you helped a lot

1060
42:46.239 --> 42:47.159
for its success today.

1061
42:47.760 --> 42:49.199
I was pretty surprised.

1062
42:49.559 --> 42:50.679
I had no idea

1063
42:50.719 --> 42:51.840
you were so capable before.

1064
42:52.840 --> 42:54.039
That's all in the past.

1065
42:56.920 --> 42:57.480
Weng Yue.

1066
42:59.920 --> 43:00.440
Honey,

1067
43:00.920 --> 43:02.360
the hand cream ran out,

1068
43:02.840 --> 43:04.039
and I haven't replaced it yet.

1069
43:06.519 --> 43:08.559
You have to put lotion on wet hands,

1070
43:09.000 --> 43:10.280
or the wind will dry them out.

1071
43:15.599 --> 43:16.199
Mr. Di,

1072
43:16.519 --> 43:18.320
you really dote on your wife!

1073
43:18.920 --> 43:20.519
I'm so jealous of her.

1074
43:22.920 --> 43:25.159
She's so lucky.

1075
43:25.840 --> 43:26.559
I'm so envious.

1076
43:26.639 --> 43:27.360
I hope you find

1077
43:27.360 --> 43:28.280
a boyfriend like that.

1078
43:32.719 --> 43:33.239
Ma'am,

1079
43:33.480 --> 43:34.159
is Mr. Di here?

1080
43:34.480 --> 43:35.599
I need his signature

1081
43:35.679 --> 43:36.559
on this document,

1082
43:36.880 --> 43:37.679
but he didn't reply

1083
43:37.679 --> 43:38.159
on WeChat.

1084
44:08.288 --> 44:11.008
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1085
44:11.719 --> 44:13.079
It's your wife's lipstick.

1086
44:14.519 --> 44:15.296
Does it look good?

1087
44:17.000 --> 44:17.559
(I'm Jiao Xu) Does the offer still stand?

1088
44:18.519 --> 44:19.000
Of course.

1089
44:19.904 --> 44:21.320
I wanted to go to Dongji Island too.

1090
44:21.320 --> 44:22.519
I thought you went there

1091
44:22.519 --> 44:23.760
and was going to ask

1092
44:23.760 --> 44:24.400
how it was.

1093
44:27.000 --> 44:27.440
Mr. Di.

1094
44:27.840 --> 44:29.599
Meng wanted duck soup with bamboo shoots.

1095
44:29.599 --> 44:30.800
I'll add some cordyceps.

1096
44:31.000 --> 44:32.280
I heard Dongji Island

1097
44:32.599 --> 44:34.000
is a place you go with a partner.

1098
44:34.480 --> 44:35.360
Were you with yours?

1099
44:35.360 --> 44:36.280
I'd waited for her

1100
44:36.280 --> 44:37.079
to come to me.

1101
44:37.800 --> 44:38.599
And today,

1102
44:39.840 --> 44:40.480
she did.

1103
45:08.192 --> 45:12.032
♪How to balance♪

1104
45:15.264 --> 45:18.848
♪Lessons never taught♪

1105
45:22.432 --> 45:27.392
♪If choices must be made♪

1106
45:28.672 --> 45:33.152
♪I'll hold onto my innocence♪

1107
45:35.328 --> 45:38.752
♪I was never the clever one♪

1108
45:39.072 --> 45:42.464
♪Just trying to live with heart♪

1109
45:42.624 --> 45:48.608
♪To love, to hate, to seek a more genuine soul♪

1110
45:48.736 --> 45:53.376
♪Some embrace while some turn cold♪

1111
45:53.472 --> 45:58.976
♪The ones who stay are the sincerest♪

1112
45:59.648 --> 46:06.528
♪We cannot let go♪

1113
46:20.256 --> 46:23.584
♪I was never the clever one♪

1114
46:23.840 --> 46:27.328
♪Just trying to live with heart♪

1115
46:27.424 --> 46:33.440
♪To love, to hate, to seek a more genuine soul♪

1116
46:33.504 --> 46:37.952
♪Some embrace while some turn cold♪

1117
46:38.208 --> 46:44.000
♪The ones who stay are the sincerest♪

1118
